**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.DS_Store

# Measurement rig rather than application. `.npmrc` pins pnpm's virtual store to
# an absolute path on the measuring machine, `.benchmark-deps` holds the packed
# toolchain each workspace installs from, and `.playwright-mcp` is the browser
# tool's own console and page scratch.
**/.npmrc
**/.benchmark-deps/
**/.playwright-mcp/
**/.build-cache/
**/.ttsc-repair-*/

# Build output, named the way each workspace names it. A blanket `**/lib/` would
# also swallow `packages/frontend/src/lib`, which is where the hooks live.
**/packages/api/lib/
**/packages/backend/bin/
**/packages/backend/lib/
**/packages/backend/src/prisma/
**/packages/frontend/dist/
**/packages/*/.nestia-debug-out/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

**/*.log
**/*.err
**/*.out
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tmp
